00:57:14.260 --> 00:57:16.690
Dad, don't do what he wants.

00:57:19.960 --> 00:57:29.480
How is it, Trog?

00:57:49.710 --> 00:57:59.570
I'll try to show you what kind of torture tools we have, so that our professor knows.

00:58:00.030 --> 00:58:10.000
ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha try to imagine if this tool touches your daughter's neck

00:58:10.000 --> 00:58:26.280
I will cut it into two, think about it, choose one of the two, the result of your discovery or your daughter's

00:58:34.570 --> 00:58:38.270
Yes, I will give up the result of my discovery.

00:58:38.270 --> 00:58:39.270
Dad!

00:58:39.270 --> 00:58:42.270
Finally give up too.

00:58:42.270 --> 00:58:43.250
Good, good.

00:58:43.250 --> 00:58:45.910
But let go of my son first.

00:58:45.910 --> 00:58:47.760
It's okay, of course I'll let go.

00:58:47.760 --> 00:58:51.380
But I've burned my dress.

00:58:51.380 --> 00:58:53.650
Oh, that's easy.

00:58:53.650 --> 00:58:54.650
Hey, Ben, Ben.

00:58:54.650 --> 00:58:56.890
Take your pen and paper.

00:58:56.890 --> 00:58:58.040
Okay.

00:59:04.030 --> 00:59:09.980
I don't want to.

00:59:09.980 --> 00:59:13.540
Dad!

00:59:13.540 --> 00:59:17.210
Police, I want to talk to you.

00:59:17.210 --> 00:59:18.890
Calm down.

00:59:18.890 --> 00:59:19.390
Sir.

00:59:19.390 --> 00:59:20.240
Huh?

00:59:20.240 --> 00:59:21.120
I have a report, sir.

00:59:21.120 --> 00:59:21.750
What is it?

00:59:21.750 --> 00:59:23.840
There's a danger.

00:59:23.840 --> 00:59:25.090
Ramah, sir.

00:59:25.090 --> 00:59:25.870
Why?

00:59:25.870 --> 00:59:27.260
Ramah is coming to Nyerbu, sir.

00:59:27.260 --> 00:59:29.860
Ah!

00:59:30.060 --> 00:59:31.060
Go!

00:59:31.060 --> 00:59:34.140
You can't fight against one person!

00:59:34.140 --> 00:59:37.330
Go!

00:59:37.330 --> 00:59:38.660
Go!

00:59:38.660 --> 00:59:39.700
Fight him!

01:01:00.000 --> 01:01:13.740
The black dragon ran away from the door there.

01:01:21.010 --> 01:01:22.840
Welcome Rama.

01:01:24.690 --> 01:01:30.000
Welcome to my land, Rama.

01:01:31.000 --> 01:01:33.860
Come on, accept my welcome.

01:01:35.100 --> 01:01:37.070
Fight against my robot.

01:01:37.070 --> 01:01:39.150
Come on.

01:01:39.150 --> 01:01:41.180
Yes, yes, yes.

01:01:41.180 --> 01:01:44.340
Go on, destroy all your power.

01:01:44.340 --> 01:01:45.340
Come on.

01:01:48.770 --> 01:01:50.450
Come on.

01:01:55.650 --> 01:01:58.700
Yes, you can't get away from the grip of my robot.

01:01:58.700 --> 01:01:59.700
Come on.

01:02:00.350 --> 01:02:14.400
I'll throw you out. You won't get away. You're scared, aren't you?

01:04:23.640 --> 01:04:24.960
107, 106

01:04:48.300 --> 01:04:50.220
Black Dragon's army is under attack.

01:04:50.220 --> 01:04:53.420
Good. Kurno, congratulations. Follow me.

01:05:04.160 --> 01:05:07.140
109-107, crew is ready for action.

01:05:08.190 --> 01:05:10.950
109-107, crew is ready for action.

01:05:12.420 --> 01:05:13.990
107, please come in.

01:05:15.610 --> 01:05:16.510
Ready for action.

01:05:17.620 --> 01:05:18.180
Go!

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:01.570
...my grip, Prof.

01:06:01.570 --> 01:06:02.850
Huh?

01:06:07.510 --> 01:06:17.540
Thank you.

01:06:30.600 --> 01:06:35.810
Sorry, we're late. Who did all this?

01:06:35.810 --> 01:06:36.720
Rama, sir.

01:06:36.720 --> 01:06:38.240
- Rama? - Yes.

01:06:38.240 --> 01:06:41.850
That's right. Rama came just in time.

01:06:41.850 --> 01:06:46.420
Weird. Every time there's a crime, he always shows up to catch it.

01:06:46.420 --> 01:06:51.730
Hmm, who is he really, sir? The police that caught him?

01:06:51.730 --> 01:06:55.570
We ourselves haven't killed him yet.

01:06:55.570 --> 01:06:59.640
Obviously, he is the perpetrator of the crime and the defender of justice.

01:07:00.160 --> 01:07:02.350
We salute him for all his actions.

01:07:02.350 --> 01:07:07.500
Uh, may I open the cover, sir?

01:07:07.500 --> 01:07:10.370
Just a moment.

01:07:10.370 --> 01:07:26.840
Professor, do you know him?

01:07:26.840 --> 01:07:28.390
He is my colleague.

01:07:30.700 --> 01:07:33.230
You really know how to play, Sandiwara.

01:07:33.230 --> 01:07:37.240
I didn't expect you to be so bold.

01:08:29.560 --> 01:08:30.000
I'm sorry.

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:39.530
Yes, mother. - Okay.

01:08:39.610 --> 01:08:41.860
You? - Yes.

01:08:41.940 --> 01:08:45.140
Bring her to the police station immediately.

01:08:45.220 --> 01:08:49.240
Look, come with me. - Yes, father.

01:08:49.320 --> 01:08:53.720
Please, father. Let's go.

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:01.780
Then I was carried up here.

01:10:02.720 --> 01:10:05.380
-The masked man? -Yes, the masked man.

01:10:05.380 --> 01:10:07.910
-He's Rama, right? -Rama.

01:10:12.230 --> 01:10:14.230
Thank God, you're fine.

01:10:16.850 --> 01:10:21.970
He was helped by Rama, Dad. We were also helped by Rama.

01:10:21.970 --> 01:10:25.570
If it wasn't for him, we would all be dead.

01:10:25.570 --> 01:10:28.750
Alright, let's go to the market.

01:10:28.750 --> 01:10:29.600
Let's go.

01:10:39.690 --> 01:10:41.330
I don't know who went there.

01:10:41.550 --> 01:10:44.630
Who? - Uncle.
